4796_623719809993409_4410330902145971880_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6OwZMhT2pvYQ7kNvwGoKTVI&_nc_oc=Adq_F8Z9VnAL8z-oJjDNKN52Kfvfhu8moOS-NAQndplrGpJJ5FIZTj0rIDyuyX4sm5w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSzu89L46pBLXrKxf_aQRvDhC9BwZfRFb2TSywvI0VxqQ&oe=6AFDD8DE"}, "display_name": "MazeBall", "keywords": ["mazeball", "puzzle", "mixedreality", "toy", "Physics"], "long_description": "# Early access special price, includes 12 different maps!\n\n# The favorite toy is now in Mixed Reality! - \n- Enjoy exciting mazes, tracks, and an all-new arcade mode!\n- Experience realistic physics that bring the ball to life in Mixed Reality!\n\n# Use hand tracking to control the ball \u2013 no controllers needed!\n{558691627060910}\n\n# Arcade mode with maps only available in Mixed Reality!\n\n{8515711355206315}\n\n# Speed run against other players around the world!\n\n{1275387267005139}\n\n# Scale the ball to any size, move it around your room, and create your perfect gameplay setup.\n\n{986706286830904}\n\n# Interact with your loyal flying droid companion \u2013 or just annoy it for fun!\n\n{546369714954430}\n\n# Upcoming features - \n- **Level builder.**\n- **Ball decals.**\n- **And much more to come!!**\n\nEarly gameplay footage was captured on the Meta Quest 3.", "short_description": "Control the ball with Hand Tracking in Mixed Reality! Enjoy realistic physics while solving mazes, avoiding falls, and exploring amazing levels."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.kissistudio.com/mazeball-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Kissi Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.kissistudio.com/mazeball", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1